{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社報道，Google已確認將帶有補償方案的自願離職計劃擴大至加拿大、法國、德國、日本和瑞士的部分員工。在持續增加人工智能投入的同時，Google正通過調整人員和資源配置控制成本。最新一輪計劃未覆蓋重點投入的Google Cloud和DeepMind。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585006.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:05:28.694437+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:41:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:23.677513+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:23.677513+00:00","content_hash":"301a80eb4484596af32013d68166fea886f8dc6da3f19225b4c005e672ef8556","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}